# Played on the panel (docs/16 MG3), Macro as Sound 1, Shapes as
# Sound 2 through an Ensemble insert, Plate as the master: PLAY/STOP;
# SHIFT (SEL held) + PRESETS makes Sound 2 current; hold LFO and turn KNOB3,
# Sound 2's Color: LFO1 into S2 Color. FX mode, SELECT back to In1 (its
# Ensemble): hold ENV and turn KNOB1, its Mix; SELECT on to M1 (Plate):
# hold ENV and turn KNOB2, its Decay. A key plays Sound 2. EDIT: an empty
# slot's target picker opens at Sound 2 (its Timbre), two detents on to
# its Color; KNOB3 commits it and sets the amount. HOME; SHIFT + PRESETS
# back to Sound 1; hold LFO and turn KNOB3, Macro's Timbre; a MIDI note
# plays it. It ends on HOME, whose screen the module and the harness compare.
--button 0.05:PLAY/STOP
--button 0.10:SEL:0.20
--turn 0.15:PRESETS:1
--button 0.30:LFO:0.30
--turn 0.35:KNOB3:40
--button 0.70:FX
--turn 0.75:SELECT:-64
--button 0.80:ENV:0.15
--turn 0.85:KNOB1:50
--turn 1.00:SELECT:3
--button 1.05:ENV:0.30
--turn 1.10:KNOB2:-35
--key 1.20:7:100:0.40
--button 1.40:EDIT
--turn 1.45:SELECT:5
--turn 1.50:KNOB2:2
--turn 1.70:KNOB3:55
--button 1.90:HOME
--button 2.00:SEL:0.20
--turn 2.05:PRESETS:-1
--button 2.20:LFO:0.20
--turn 2.25:KNOB3:-30
--note 2.40:60:90:0.30
